        "Abstract": "Event Detection (ED) is the task of identifying and classifying trigger words of event mentions in text. Despite considerable research efforts in recent years for English text, the task of ED in other languages has been significantly less explored. To address such issues, our goal is to introduce a new Multilingual Event Detection dataset (called MINION) to support multilingual research for ED. In particular, we provide a large-scale dataset that manually annotates event triggers for 8 typologically different languages, i.e., English, Spanish, Portuguese, Polish, Turkish, Hindi, Japanese, and Korean."
